{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi3ocxEaAwGXfVDpmH9r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Lw4jFvEjTEqhDZV9r2z8aj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > docs/DATA.md <<'EOF'\n# Thugby Turbo data guide (for designers)\nAll content lives in `src/10-data.js`: `TEAMS` (kit colours, names, style, `mod` strength, `boss`), `VENUES` (weather, ambient, hazard\n`mud|wind|flames|lightning`), `CUP` (opponent, venue, story lines), `DRILLS` (text, goal, `cond(match)`), `POWERUPS`, `LINES`\n(commentary). Balance numbers are the `TUNE` registry in `src/00-core.js` (`TUNE.add(key,label,group,value,min,max,step,unit)`) and\nshow up as live sliders in Dev Mode (pause menu, DEV MODE). Rules are in `src/20-24`, drawing in `30-33`, scenes in `40-43`.\nBuild: `node build.mjs`. Tests: `node test/all.mjs` (sim suite, browser checks, scripted playthrough, AI Hub harness).\nEOF\ncat > test/all.mjs <<'EOF'\n// node test/all.mjs — runs every suite; prints only failures and one count line\nimport { spawnSync } from 'node:child_process';\nlet total = 0, bad = 0; const out = [];\nfor (const f of ['run.mjs', 'browser.mjs', 'playthrough.mjs', 'hub.mjs']) { const r = spawnSync('node', ['test/' + f], { encoding: 'utf8', cwd: new URL('../', import.meta.url).pathname, timeout: 900000 }); const t = (r.stdout + r.stderr).trim(); const m = t.match(/(\\d+) (?:FAILED|checks|browser|playthrough|hub)/); if (r.status !== 0) { bad++; out.push(f + ':\\n' + t.split('\\n').slice(-8).join('\\n')); } total += +(t.match(/all (\\d+)/) || [0, 0])[1]; }\nconsole.log(bad ? out.join('\\n') + '\\nFAILED suites: ' + bad : 'all ' + total + ' checks passed across 4 suites'); process.exit(bad ? 1 : 0);\nEOF\nnode build.mjs && node test/all.mjs 2>&1 | tail -15"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5262,"cache_read_input_