{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The four sections are present in the final reply and the HTML and exit-interview.json exist with valid JSON. But the transcript does not establish that every TASK.md feature is implemented: the Xbox glyph option and physical pad input were never tested on hardware (the reply says so), and the final reply itself notes the six-suite command was not re-run after adding dev.mjs. The 'no stubs' requirement is only partly supported by the transcript."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3e580ef-9188-4ffd-962e-28d451837174","uuid":"299b28ae-5ee3-4fdf-ae68-1a922f89a6f8","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:38:12.372Z","isSynthetic":true}
