{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi4ingMdDtwzmc6a4H8Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Controller input is now covered by a new test, `test/pad.mjs`, which runs against a fake standard-mapping gamepad. I'm re-running all seven suites in the background and will report the combined count when that finishes.\n\nThe pad test passed on its own, 9 of 9 checks:\n- Pad input is detected as the last device, so on-screen prompts switch to controller glyphs.\n- D-pad and X (Cross) navigate the menus into Exhibition.\n- A match starts from the pad.\n- The left stick with R2 (turbo) runs the ball carrier.\n- Cross sidesteps.\n- L1 passes up the screen to a teammate.\n- Holding then releasing Circle kicks.\n- Triangle fires a Thunder Run super.\n- Options pauses the game.\n\nMy first run of this test failed twice, both from test mistakes I corrected. An extra D-pad press sent the menu to Training instead of Exhibition, and the L1 check ran in the wrong scene. I did not change the game.\n\nThis still isn't a physical DualSense or Xbox pad, so real-hardware quirks such as dead zones and rumble are untested. The standard-mapping input path is covered, and the Xbox glyphs render correctly in a screenshot."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_read_input_tokens":398579,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":678},"output_tokens":406,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3e580ef-9188-4ffd-962e-28d451837174","uuid":"bcbf6c52-ed87-4367-9bca-82047d43288d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:43:05.218Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi4inMG7wV6LcNYYqyoM"}
